		"description": "<p>You strike toward nothing, swinging your weapon at empty air, but halfway through the motion you teleport to your target to finish the strike. Choose a target within 60ft of you. You take the attack action and teleport adjacent to your target. The first attack you make during this attack action gains advantage, and your speed becomes 0 until the start of your next turn.</p>",
